  "body": [
    "Sustainable consumption and business have become the expectation rather than the exception. Fairtrade offers ready solutions for companies of all sizes to manage risks in their supply chains.",
    "Recognition Recognition Consumers know and trust Fairtrade – We're the most widely recognized ethical label in the world, with about seven in ten consumers saying the mark has a positive impact on their perception of brands. Find out more",
    "Sourcing models that meet your needs Sourcing models that meet your needs Fairtrade offers different approaches that enable companies to make their supply chains sustainable and transparent.",
    "Stable business relationships with suppliers Stable business relationships with suppliers Fairtrade fosters long-term trading partnerships and empowers producers through training and support to increase quality and responsiveness to market trends.",
    "A certification and assurance system you can trust A certification and assurance system you can trust Fairtrade’s certification system is rigorous, independent and aligned with best-in-class practice, involving regular on-site visits by trained auditors. Our assurance scheme is compliant with ISEAL’s Assurance Code, an international code for sustainability standards. Find out more about assurance",
    "Solutions on living wages and living incomes Solutions on living wages and living incomes Fairtrade provides tools for companies to contribute to improved livelihoods in their supply chains. Discover our latest offer for bananas",
    "Expertise to support your company's due diligence Expertise to support your company's due diligence Whether you’re a business taking your first steps on your human rights and environmental due diligence the (HREDD) journey, or looking for more in-depth risk assessments and action plans, Fairtrade is your partner. Find out more",
    "+37K Fairtrade products available to shoppers worldwide.",
    "There is an enormous variety of products covered by the Fairtrade Standards. Each purchase of a Fairtrade product can make a real difference for farmers and workers around the world.",
    "Want to keep learning about how Fairtrade can support your business? Our team is here to help."
  ],
